rmula\n\n$$\nS=\\int 2\\pi y\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nSince we're given a curve in the form $y=f(x),$ we have \n\n$$\n\\text{d}s=\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we will use\n\n$$\nS=2\\pi {\\int }_{{x}_{1}}^{{x}_{2}}y\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe are told that the limits of integration are from ${x}_{1}=-1$ to ${x}_{2}=1.$ \n\nComputing the derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}})=-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,⇒\\,{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}^{2}=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4-{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S & =2\\pi {\\int }_{{x}_{1}}^{{x}_{2}}y\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\pi {\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}\\sqrt{1+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\pi {\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\pi {\\int }_{-1}^{1}2\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\pi x\\,{|}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =4\\pi [1-(-1)] \\\\  & =8\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-cbe7ea72-e04a-55e6-a4f7-365b15606888" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-54638d73-c9f4-5d31-93a7-16d80e13c507" :answer-field/id #uuid "54638d73-c9f4-5d31-93a7-16d80e13c507"] ["answer-3e914b0d-41ca-50e1-920b-daa562691bf8" :answer/id #uuid "3e914b0d-41ca-50e1-920b-daa562691bf8"] ["answer-3e914b0d-41ca-50e1-920b-daa562691bf8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3e914b0d-41ca-50e1-920b-daa562691bf8" :answer/value "12\\pi "] ["answer-d807f0fc-fb4a-570e-8af5-96a9583d0e92" :answer/id #uuid "d807f0fc-fb4a-570e-8af5-96a9583d0e92"] ["answer-d807f0fc-fb4a-570e-8af5-96a9583d0e92" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d807f0fc-fb4a-570e-8af5-96a9583d0e92" :answer/value "4\\pi "] ["answer-bacbe449-5ccd-5971-8f8e-92d50f996dba" :answer/id #uuid "bacbe449-5ccd-5971-8f8e-92d50f996dba"] ["answer-bacbe449-5ccd-5